   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Color Contrast Arrangements</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Color Contrast Arrangements\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication with the original images: twelve colored versions of one simplified street silhouette of five buildings inspired by traditional Istanbul houses, drawn by the authors on a mid-grey background, each colored with one Color Contrast Arrangement of three Munsell colors: single contrasts (hue, value, chroma; each with warm and cool colors) and double contrasts (equivalent hues, values or chromas with a dominant contrast), two examples of each, with the largest facade as the emphasized element. As in the paper's first survey (Q1), participants first answer background questions (gender, age, education, profession, color vision deficiency, education in color-related subjects, professional involvement in color), then see the twelve visuals one after another and for each rate the paper's three statements, The colors in the visual are harmonious with one another, I would prefer to see this color arrangement in my surroundings and I liked the color arrangement in the visual, on its 3-point scale (1 = negative, 3 = positive), and give three adjectives that best describe the visual. Rebuilt from Zümrüt Tokçiftçi & Küçükkılıç Özcan (2026), Evaluation of Color Contrast Arrangements in Terms of Harmony, Preference and Liking, Buildings 16(14): 2906, with the visuals cropped from its Table 3 (the visual numbers trimmed off) and the statements, scale and background topics from its Section 3 (CC BY 4.0). Image ids: CA01-CA12 (the paper's arrangement numbers); answers are in harmony, preference, liking and adjectives, keyed by image id; the arrangement type of each is stored in the page's original-study block. Analysis as in the paper: exclude participants reporting a color vision deficiency, then for each arrangement sum the shares of positive (3) and moderate (2) answers per statement and rank the twelve arrangements on harmony, preference and liking, compare the rankings with Spearman correlations, and count the adjectives; the paper (109 participants with normal color vision, Google Forms) found value-contrast arrangements most harmonious and equivalent chroma and hue arrangements least, CA08 (equivalent hues, value contrast dominant) first in harmony and liking, CA12 last in all three, and cool schemes generally preferred to warm ones. Differences from the original study: (1) only the first survey is included; the second survey's nine bipolar adjective pairs are not, because the paper prints only their positive ends (organized, balanced, similar, good, peaceful, relaxing, beautiful, tasteful, pleasant); (2) the background question wording, the middle label of the scale (neutral), the instruction text and the order of the visuals (CA01 to CA12, as numbered in the paper) are ours; (3) the visuals are the copies printed in Table 3 (about 420 px wide, shown enlarged), not the original files; (4) the paper recruited through social media, email and messaging applications; here anyone can take part.\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"arrangements\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"inputType\": \"number\",\n      \"title\": \"Age (years)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"min\": 16,\n      \"max\": 100\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"education\",\n      \"title\": \"Educational background (highest completed)\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"Primary school\",\n        \"text\": \"Primary school\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"High school\",\n        \"text\": \"High school\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"Bachelor's degree\",\n        \"text\": \"Bachelor's degree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"Master's degree\",\n        \"text\": \"Master's degree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"Doctorate\",\n        \"text\": \"Doctorate\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"profession\",\n      \"title\": \"Profession\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"color_vision_deficiency\",\n      \"title\": \"Do you have any color vision deficiency?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"no\",\n        \"text\": \"No\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"yes\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"color_education\",\n      \"title\": \"Have you received education in color-related subjects?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"no\",\n        \"text\": \"No\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"yes\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"color_profession\",\n      \"title\": \"Are you professionally involved in the field of color?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"no\",\n        \"text\": \"No\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"yes\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"visuals\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"harmony\",\n      \"title\": \"The colors in the visual are harmonious with one another.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rateValues\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Negative\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Neutral\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Positive\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Keyed by image id (CA01-CA12).\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"preference\",\n      \"title\": \"I would prefer to see this color arrangement in my surroundings.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rateValues\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Negative\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Neutral\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Positive\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Keyed by image id.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"liking\",\n      \"title\": \"I liked the color arrangement in the visual.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rateValues\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"Negative\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"Neutral\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"Positive\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Keyed by image id.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"adjectives\",\n      \"title\": \"Three adjectives that best describe this visual\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Keyed by image id; value is a list of three words.\"\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"color-original\">{\"source\": \"Zümrüt Tokçiftçi & Küçükkılıç Özcan (2026) Buildings 16: 2906\", \"n\": 109, \"arrangements\": [{\"id\": \"CA01\", \"group\": \"Single\", \"name\": \"Hue contrast (emphasized element: warm color)\"}, {\"id\": \"CA02\", \"group\": \"Single\", \"name\": \"Hue contrast (emphasized element: cool color)\"}, {\"id\": \"CA03\", \"group\": \"Single\", \"name\": \"Value contrast (warm colors)\"}, {\"id\": \"CA04\", \"group\": \"Single\", \"name\": \"Value contrast (cool colors)\"}, {\"id\": \"CA05\", \"group\": \"Single\", \"name\": \"Chroma contrast (warm colors)\"}, {\"id\": \"CA06\", \"group\": \"Single\", \"name\": \"Chroma contrast (cool colors)\"}, {\"id\": \"CA07\", \"group\": \"Double\", \"name\": \"Equivalent hues (dominant: chroma contrast)\"}, {\"id\": \"CA08\", \"group\": \"Double\", \"name\": \"Equivalent hues (dominant: value contrast)\"}, {\"id\": \"CA09\", \"group\": \"Double\", \"name\": \"Equivalent values (dominant: hue contrast)\"}, {\"id\": \"CA10\", \"group\": \"Double\", \"name\": \"Equivalent values (dominant: chroma contrast)\"}, {\"id\": \"CA11\", \"group\": \"Double\", \"name\": \"Equivalent chromas (dominant: value contrast)\"}, {\"id\": \"CA12\", \"group\": \"Double\", \"name\": \"Equivalent chromas (dominant: hue contrast)\"}]}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f0f1f4;--card:#fff;--ink:#1c1f26;--muted:#5b616d;--accent:#3a4f7a;--line:#d7dbe3;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#e1e7f3}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.15rem;margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:14px;margin-top:14px}\n.b{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:10px}\n.b img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border-radius:8px}\n.b .no{font-weight:700;margin:6px 0 4px}\n.o{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:3px}\n.o label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:2px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:5px 1px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.68rem;line-height:1.15;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}\n.o label b{font-size:.95rem;color:var(--ink)}\n.o label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--ink)}\n.o input{display:none}\n.b.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:2px}\n.blk{margin-top:14px}.blk:first-child{margin-top:0}\n.blk.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:4px;border-radius:8px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\nlabel.opt:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.vis{max-width:860px;margin:0 auto}.vis img{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border-radius:8px;background:#7f7f7f}\n.st{margin-top:12px}.st p{margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}\n.adj{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;margin-top:6px}\ninput.tx{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;width:100%;min-width:0}\n.top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:10px}\n@media (max-width:520px){.adj{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Visuals and statements: Zümrüt Tokçiftçi &amp; Küçükkılıç Özcan (2026), Buildings 16(14): 2906, Table 3 and Section 3 (doi:10.3390/buildings16142906, CC BY 4.0).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='color-contrast:state', ORIG=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('color-original').textContent), IDS=ORIG.arrangements.map(function(a){return a.id;}),\n      BG=['gender','age','education','profession','color_vision_deficiency','color_education','color_profession'], ST=['harmony','preference','liking'];\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Colors on building facades</h1><p>You will see twelve drawings of the same street of five buildings, each painted with a different combination of three colors. For each drawing, say how much you agree with three short statements and write three adjectives that describe it. First, a few questions about you. It takes about 10 minutes.</p>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){st.step='about';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function about(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>About you</h2><div class=\"card\">'+BG.map(function(n){var q=Q[n];\n      if(q.type==='text')return '<div class=\"blk\" data-n=\"'+n+'\"><b>'+esc(q.title)+'</b><div><input class=\"tx\" '+(q.inputType==='number'?'type=\"number\" inputmode=\"numeric\" style=\"width:9em\"':'type=\"text\" maxlength=\"120\"')+' id=\"in_'+n+'\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"></div></div>';\n      return '<div class=\"blk\" data-n=\"'+n+'\"><b>'+esc(q.title)+'</b>'+(q.choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}).join('')+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Continue</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var L=[],miss=[];\n      BG.forEach(function(n){var q=Q[n],blk=app.querySelector('.blk[data-n=\"'+n+'\"]');\n        if(q.type==='text'){var raw=(document.getElementById('in_'+n)||{}).value||'';\n          if(q.inputType==='number'){var v=Number(raw);if(raw&&v>=(q.min||0)&&v<=(q.max||120))L.push(SPSite.answer(n,v));else miss.push(blk);}\n          else{raw=raw.trim();if(raw)L.push(SPSite.answer(n,raw));else miss.push(blk);}return;}\n        var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');if(x)L.push(SPSite.answer(n,x.value));else miss.push(blk);});\n      if(miss.length){miss.forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('miss');});miss[0].scrollIntoView({block:'center'});return err('Please answer all questions (age as a number from 16 to 100).');}\n      send(L,this,function(){st.step='vis';st.i=0;save();route();});};\n  }\n  function vis(){\n    var k=st.i,id=IDS[k],sc=Q.harmony.rateValues||[];\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"top\"><h2>Visual '+(k+1)+' of '+IDS.length+'</h2></div><div class=\"vis\"><img alt=\"Street of five buildings, color arrangement '+(k+1)+'\" src=\"'+esc(files[id].url)+'\"></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\">'+ST.map(function(n){return '<div class=\"st blk\" data-n=\"'+n+'\"><p>'+esc(Q[n].title)+'</p><div class=\"o\">'+sc.map(function(s){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+s.value+'\"><b>'+s.value+'</b>'+esc(s.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div></div>';}).join('')+\n      '<div class=\"st blk\" data-n=\"adjectives\"><p>'+esc(Q.adjectives.title)+'</p><div class=\"adj\">'+[0,1,2].map(function(j){return '<input class=\"tx\" type=\"text\" maxlength=\"40\" id=\"adj'+j+'\" placeholder=\"Adjective '+(j+1)+'\">';}).join('')+'</div></div>'+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+(k<IDS.length-1?'Next visual':'Finish')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var L=[],miss=[],sh=[files[id].name];\n      ST.forEach(function(n){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+n+'\"]:checked');if(x)L.push(SPSite.answer(n,Number(x.value),{key:id,shown:sh}));else miss.push(app.querySelector('.blk[data-n=\"'+n+'\"]'));});\n      var w=[0,1,2].map(function(j){return (document.getElementById('adj'+j).value||'').trim();});\n      if(w.some(function(x){return !x;}))miss.push(app.querySelector('.blk[data-n=\"adjectives\"]'));else L.push(SPSite.answer('adjectives',w,{key:id,shown:sh}));\n      if(miss.length){miss.forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('miss');});return err('Please answer the three statements and write three adjectives.');}\n      send(L,this,function(){if(k<IDS.length-1)st.i=k+1;else st.step='done';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  function clr(e){var r=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('.blk');if(r){r.classList.remove('miss');if(!app.querySelector('.miss'))err('');}}\n  app.addEventListener('input',clr);app.addEventListener('change',clr);\n  function route(){var s=st.step;window.scrollTo(0,0);if(s==='about')return about();if(s==='vis')return vis();if(s==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','adjectives'].concat(BG,ST).forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('arrangements')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'')]=f;});\n    var need=IDS.filter(function(k){return !files[k];});\n    if(need.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload '+esc(need.join(', '))+' (.png) to the media folder \"arrangements\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    if(!(st&&st.step)||a.consent!==true)st={step:'intro'};\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
